From bda0979bd5d093a904d823cafac6bf0801ce4f4c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Amelie Delaunay <amelie.delaunay@foss.st.com>
Date: Fri, 3 Oct 2025 17:47:59 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] ARM: dts: stm32: add phase tags marking on stm32mp15 eval
 board

bootph-all/bootph-some-ram/bootph-pre-ram as phase tags were added to
dt-schema (dtschema/schemas/bootph.yaml) to describe various node usage
during boot phases with DT.

Describe them for STM32MP15 EVAL boot devices.

Change-Id: I501dc5f5bec0934c2032648941047608cce3579a
Signed-off-by: Amelie Delaunay <amelie.delaunay@foss.st.com>
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/st/linux-stm32/+/496298
ACI: CIBUILD <MDG-smet-aci-builds@list.st.com>
Reviewed-by: Patrice CHOTARD <patrice.chotard@foss.st.com>
ACI: CITOOLS <MDG-smet-aci-reviews@list.st.com>
